                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#RetractsOfMorphisms"}
          .proof
            %h6#proof_4 Proof
            %p
              This is an immediate consequence of the general fact (
              %a{:href => "injective+or+projective+morphism#ClosurePropertiesOfInjectiveAndProjectiveMorphisms"}> here
              ) that classes of morphisms characterized by a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/left+lifting+property"} left lifting property
              are closed under the operations of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coproducts"} coproducts
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pushouts"} pushouts
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/retracts"} retracts
              and
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/transfinite+composition"} transfinite composition
