          #SmashProductOnTopNotAssociative.num_remark
            %h6#remark_7 Remark
            %p
              For a general category
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝒞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
              in def.
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SmashProductOfPointedObjects"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smash+product"} smash product
              need not be
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/associativity"} associative
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo ×
                    %mi Z
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (-)\times Z
              does not preserve the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quotients"} quotients
              involved in the definition.
            %p
              In particular this may happen for
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝒞
                    %mo =
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C} =
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Top"} Top
            %p
              A sufficient condition for
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo ×
                    %mi Z
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (-) \times Z
              to preserve quotients is that it is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/left+adjoint"} left adjoint
              functor. This is the case in the smaller subcategory of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compactly+generated+topological+spaces"} compactly generated topological spaces
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SmashProductInTopcgIsAssociative"}
              below.
          %p
            These two operations are going to be ubiquituous in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+homotopy+theory"} stable homotopy theory
