          %h4#compactly_generated_weakly_hausdorff_spaces Compactly generated weakly Hausdorff spaces
          %p
            While the inclusion
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi Top
                    %mi cg
