            %a{:href => "#ModelStructureOnCompactlyGeneratedTopologicalSpaces"} above
            does satisfy the requirement that it gives a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cartesian+closed+category"} cartesian closed category
            with all
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/limits"} limits
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/colimits"} colimits
            and containing all
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CW-complexes"} CW-complexes
          %p
            One may in addition demand all compactly generated spaces to be
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hausdorff+topological+spaces"} Hausdorff topological spaces
            (e. g.
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#Hirschhorn15"} Hirschhorn 15, top of p. 2
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/colimits"} colimits
            land again in Hausdorff space.
          %p
