                in
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi Top
                        %mi cgwH
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Top_{cgwH}
                quotient spaces are not only preserved by
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cartesian+products"} cartesian products
                (as is the case for all compactly generated spaces due to
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
