                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi Top
                        %mi cgwH
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Top_{cgwH}
                the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/regular+monomorphisms"} regular monomorphisms
                are the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/closed+subspace"} closed subspace
                inclusions (
