          #PushoutProductWithInitialMorphism.num_example
            %h6#example_12 Example
            %p
              The pushout product with an
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/initial+object"} initial
              morphism is just the ordinary
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartesian+product"} Cartesian product
              functor
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
