                      %mrow
                        %mo *
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Top_k^{\ast/}
              form a pointed topologically enriched category.
          #TopologicallyEnrichedFunctor.num_defn
            %h6#definition_28 Definition
            %p
              A
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topologically+enriched+functor"} topologically enriched functor
